# E-Commerce MERN Platform 🛒

A fully functional **full-stack MERN e-commerce application** with a responsive **frontend**, **admin panel**, and a production-ready **backend**. Integrated with **Razorpay payments**, **Cloudinary media handling**, and **JWT-based authentication**.

